me>Kurimoto</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Yabuta</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Ohinata</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Ono</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Uno</surname><given-names>KD</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamada</surname><given-names>RG</given-names></name><name><surname>Ueda</surname><given-names>HR</given-names></name><name><surname>Saitou</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An improved single-cell cDNA amplification method for efficient high-density oligonucleotide microarray analysis</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>e42</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16547197</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/nar/gkl050</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Luo</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Salunga</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name><name><surname>Guo</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Bittner</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Joy</surname><given-names>KC</given-names></name><name><surname>Galindo</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Xiao</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Rogers</surname><given-names>KE</given-names></name><name><surname>Wan</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Jackson</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Gene expression profiles of laser-captured adjacent neuronal subtypes</article-title><source>Nat Med</source><year>1999</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>117</fpage><lpage>122</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9883850</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/4806</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><pers